  <metadata>
    <name>Karanfili Ridge: viewpoint – Mali Karanfil</name>
    <desc>A short but highly demanding ridge trail, 1.7 km long, leading through the rocky terrain of Prokletije. Suitable exclusively for experienced hikers with appropriate equipment. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
